Abstract digital art of a single large soft sphere of electric blue #4F83FF light bleeding in from the bottom-right corner, fading through deep midnight navy #141A2E into near-black #0A0A0C. Subtle drifting atmospheric haze, gentle diagonal light falloff and fine film grain give it depth, with the top region open and dark. 8K quality, ultra smooth gradients, premium feel, no text, no letters, no UI elements, no device mockups